Elements!</strong> Use portals for instant log transportation and boost bushes for maximum speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Interactions!</strong> Push each other, accidentally collide \u2013 but remember, every player who falls slows down the process!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511660/extras/Chop_Down.gif?t=1743515762\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Characters and Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All players have the same abilities but can stand out through customization! The store offers hats, character rings, and even walking particle effects. You can also improve your speed and jump using in-game currency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Locations</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Farm</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd9 <strong>City</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2744 <strong>Winter</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd20 <strong>Wild West</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete all the levels, showcase your agility and teamwork to finish construction on time! Ready for the challenge? Then let's go \u2013 <strong>No Time to Build!</strong> \ud83d\ude80</p>","developers":["Teqes Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511660/header.jpg?t=1743515762","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.14 Mojave<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 Integrated GPU<br></li><li><str